// Sum of kept winning labeled hammings strictly above the lower central value.
// An empty above-set returns -1, not 0. This sum is never 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hlphi ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hlphi rank

IMPULSE hlphi 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lphi" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
